# API libraries

When editing under `libs/**/*-api/**/`.

## Scope

- Applies to: @ libs/**/*-api/**/*

## Conventions

- Hapi handlers, Joi validation, Drizzle; see `crss-rules`.
- Handler unit tests: `frameworks/vitest-reference-api-handler.mdc`.
- Optional Postgres integration (`*.integration.spec.ts`): `frameworks/vitest-reference-api-db-integration.mdc`.
